# Store and check out text files with LF line endings on every platform.
# Git for Windows converts to CRLF on checkout by default, and a CRLF copy of
# .ebextensions/02-backups.config writes shell scripts that bash refuses to
# run on the Elastic Beanstalk instance. The offline suite checks for this.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.zip binary
